      "reason": "Real deepseek-v4.1-flash submission (rev3): treats a result that is already in the parent session as delivered. When the user interrupts first and the fork finishes during the aborted run, pi appends the result into a turn whose request is aborted, so the model never sees it (interrupted_before_result)."
    },
